<body>
<div class="card">
<div class="meta">
  <div class="badge">QS_001 · 趋势爆品</div>
  <h1>柠檬鸡爪（无骨版）</h1>
  <div class="sub">酸辣开胃 · 网红爆品 · 摆摊/档口通吃</div>
  <div class="tags"><span>#趋势爆品</span> <span>#柠檬鸡爪</span> <span>#无骨鸡爪</span> <span>#网红</span> <span>#高复购</span> <span>#夏季</span></div>
</div>
<div class="level-banner">
  <span class="level-item high">🔥 趋势爆品</span>
  <span class="level-item">摆摊指数 9/10</span>
  <span class="level-item">复购指数 9/10</span>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📖 产品说</div>
  <div class="story">柠檬鸡爪这几年火到什么程度？抖音小红书上一搜，配方视频几百万播放。白天刷到晚上就想买，<em>它的复购率比传统卤鸡爪高出一大截</em>——酸辣开胃，吃完还想吃。<br><br>成本16-18一斤，卖28-38，毛利55-65%。有骨无骨都能做——有骨走量、无骨卖高价。关键是操作比卤鸡爪简单，不用熬卤水，泡一晚就能出摊。</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💰 成本利润</div>
  <div class="cost-box">
    <div class="row"><span>原料成本</span><span class="v">约¥16-18/斤</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>建议售价</span><span class="v">¥28-38/斤（无骨¥38-48）</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日销</span><span class="v">30-60斤</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>日营收</span><span class="v">≈¥1000-2300</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>原料成本</span><span class="v">≈¥500-1100</span></div>
    <div class="row"><span>摊位+杂费</span><span class="v">~¥30-60</span></div>
    <div class="row tot"><span>日净赚</span><span class="v">≈¥470-1140</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="roi">
    <div class="roi-b c"><div class="d">12-18天</div>保守</div>
    <div class="roi-b n"><div class="d">8-12天</div>正常</div>
    <div class="roi-b i"><div class="d">5-8天</div>理想</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">⚠️ 项目风险</div>
  <div class="risk-item"><span>季节</span><div class="risk-stars">●●●○○</div></div>
  <div class="risk-item"><span>损耗</span><div class="risk-stars">●○○○○</div></div>
  <div class="risk-item"><span>监管</span><div class="risk-stars">●○○○○</div></div>
  <div class="risk-item"><span>选址</span><div class="risk-stars">●●○○○</div></div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">🔧 启动清单</div>
  <div class="launch"><span>冻鸡爪</span><span>柠檬</span><span>百香果</span><span>小米辣</span><span>香菜</span><span>糖</span><span>白醋</span><span>蒜</span><span>姜</span><span>料酒</span><span>冰柜</span><span>不锈钢盆</span><span>真空机</span><span>包装盒</span></div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📍 适合场景</div>
  <div class="scene-grid"><span class="scene-item">夜市</span><span class="scene-item">小吃街</span><span class="scene-item">菜市场</span><span class="scene-item">社区</span><span class="scene-item">线上团购</span><span class="scene-item">外卖</span><span class="scene-item">便利店代售</span></div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">🎯 市场对标</div>
  <div class="benchmark">
    <div class="bn">网红柠檬鸡爪¥38-58/斤 vs 摆摊¥28-38/斤</div>
    <div class="bd">网红品牌靠包装+冷链溢价，摆摊现做现卖更新鲜。冻鸡爪14元/斤+配料2-3元/斤=总成本16-18元，卖28-38有55-65%毛利。无骨版人工成本高些，但售价更高。</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">💬 话术</div>
  <div class="talk">「柠檬鸡爪——酸辣爽口，吃一个就停不下来。」<br>「无骨的不用吐骨头，一口一个过瘾。」</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">📋 工艺流程</div>
  <div class="story">• 冻鸡爪解冻→剪指甲→焯水8分钟（加葱姜料酒去腥）<br>• 捞出立刻过冰水（冰水泡10分钟，皮会回缩更Q弹）<br>• 有骨版：直接对半切开<br>• 无骨版：沿鸡爪背面划一刀，剔出三根主骨（小骨保留）<br>• 调柠檬汁：柠檬片+百香果+小米辣+蒜+香菜+糖+白醋+生抽+凉白开<br>• 鸡爪泡入柠檬汁，冷藏浸泡8-12小时入味<br>• 每4小时翻一次，保证入味均匀</div>
</div>
<div class="section">
  <div class="s-title">🚫 避坑</div>
  <div class="story">• <em>焯水时间不够</em>——8分钟是底线，时间短了鸡爪不熟，久了皮会烂失去脆感。<br>• <em>不过冰水</em>——焯完直接泡柠檬汁，鸡爪热着进汁容易变软，口感全无。<br>• <em>柠檬皮泡太久发苦</em>——柠檬片腌制4小时后捞出，否则苦味会渗进汁里。<br>• <em>无骨鸡爪剔骨效率</em>——一个人一小时最多剔5斤，批量做要考虑人工成本。<br>• <em>汤汁重复用</em>——一锅汁最多泡两批，第三批味道就淡了。</div>
</div>
